   "title": "Good morning",
   "secs": 13,
   "say": "Good morning, Alex Chen presenting. Stormy again. Thirty stations that keep a schedule are quiet, down from Sunday, but nearly all of them sit behind two repeaters: Toowoomba, and now Hillcrest."
